WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:02.200
A digit's value depends on where it sits.

2
00:02.200 --> 00:04.400
The 4 is in the tens place. The 7 is in the ones place.

3
00:04.400 --> 00:09.300
4 tens is 40. 7 ones is 7.

4
00:09.300 --> 00:14.633
40 + 7 = 47

5
00:14.633 --> 00:18.133
Bigger numbers work the same way.

6
00:18.133 --> 00:22.733
The 5 is worth 500. The 2 is worth 20. The 8 is worth 8.
